  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./chromis__get_calib.html#chromis::get_calib", "chromis::get_calib", 'routine in <a href="./chromis__get_calib.html">chromis__get_calib.pro</a>', "chromis__get_calib.pro", "    Mats Löfdahl, ISP   ", "chromis::get_calib", " From state data, return file names for calibration data and the data  itself.   ", "no_fitsstatus        The status of the operation, 0 for success.   darkstatusdarkname       The name(s) of the dark file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   darkdata        The data in the dark file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   flatstatusflatname       The name(s) of the flat file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   flatdata        The data in the flat file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   gainstatusgainname       The name(s) of the gain file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   gaindata        The data in the gain file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   pinhstatuspinhname        The name(s) of the pinhole file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   pinhdata        The data in the pinhole file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   polcname        The name(s) of the polcal file(s) appropriate to the prefilter(s).   polcdata        The data in the polcal file(s) appropriate to the prefilter(s).   polsname        The name(s) of the polcal sum file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   polsdata        The data in the polcal sum file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   sflatstatussflatname       The name(s) of the summed flat file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   sflatdata        The data in the summed flat file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   cflatstatuscflatname       The name(c) of the cavityfree flat file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   cflatdata        The data in the cavityfree flat file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   cgainstatuscgainnamecgaindatasgainstatussgainname       The name(s) of the scan gain file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   sgaindata        The data in the scan gain file(s) appropriate to the state(s).   clcgainstatusclcgainnameclcgaindatatimestamp        Look for darks and flats in timestamped directories below the         regular darks/, flats/ subdirectories.   states       The states, the calibrations of which the keywords refer to.   ", "CRISP pipeline", "    2016-05-26 : MGL. Initial version including darks, flats, and                  pinholes. Added support for summed flats.      2016-05-27 : MGL. Bugfixes.      2016-06-02 : MGL. Added gains.      2016-08-23 : THI. Rename camtag to detector and channel to camera,                  so the names match those of the corresponding SolarNet                  keywords.      2016-09-04 : THI. Wideband pinhole names without narrowband                  tuning info.      2018-04-18 : MGL. Rewrote using filenames() method. Removed                  keywords for returning file headers.      2018-07-11 : MGL. New keywords, individual status for the                  different kinds of data.      2018-07-25 : Sum darks and flats, and make gains as needed.      2025-03-28 : MGL. New keyword timestamp.      2025-05-28 : MGL. Adapt to polarimetric data.   ");
  
  

