  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./crisp2__selectfiles.html#crisp2::selectfiles", "crisp2::selectfiles", 'routine in <a href="./crisp2__selectfiles.html">crisp2__selectfiles.pro</a>', "crisp2__selectfiles.pro", "     Tomas Hillberg, ISP   ", "crisp2::selectfiles", "  Select (a subset) of files and return their filenames and state information   ", "cam         Name of the camera channel. Ex. 'Crisp-W'   complement         The complement of selected.   count         The number of selected files.   dark        If no dirs were specified, use self.dark_dir   dirs         Locations where to find files.   files         File-list. No file search will be done   flat        If no dirs were specified, use self.flat_dir   force        Re-populate files/states.   fpi_statesframenumbersncomplement         The number of non-selected files.   nremove        Skip this many frames after each state-change   polcal        Set this to add polcal-specific items in the states, qw and         lp.   prefilter         only return files matching at least one of these prefilters   scan        Only return files matching these scan numbers.   selected         Return the indices for the selection. If this is not specified,          the files/states arrays will be over-written to only contain the          selection.   states         State information. Extractstates will only be called if          files were updated.   strip_settingssubdirtimestampsustat         only return files matching at least one of these states   ", "CRISP2 pipeline", "   2016-05-19 : First version.     2016-06-01 : THI. Allow filtering on camera tag.                 Pass keyword strip_settings to extractstates.     2016-06-02 : MGL. Remove some keywords to extractstates.     2016-06-09 : MGL. Bugfix: states.pref --&gt; states.prefilter.     2016-08-23 : THI. Rename camtag to detector and channel to camera,                 so the names match those of the corresponding SolarNet                 keywords.     2016-08-31 : MGL. Update file_template for data files not starting                 with the detector name.     2016-09-23 : THI. Add selection by scannumber     2016-10-13 : THI. Add selection by framenumbers and option strip_wb to                 be forwarded to extractstates     2016-10-27 : MGL. New keywords count, complement, and ncomplement.     2017-12-20 : MGL. Always do extractstates, if the files are the                 same this is a fast operation now because of caching.     2017-12-21 : MGL. Do extractstates only if needed.     2018-05-30 : MGL. Add selection by fpi_states.     2022-08-02 : MGL. CRISP2 version, based mostly on the one for                 CHROMIS.     2024-06-19 : Pit. Make camera search a substring match, as it can be                      something like 'Crisp-D, Crisp-W' for PD data   ");
  
  

