libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red__quicklook.html", "red__quicklook.pro", '.pro file in <a href="./dir-overview.html">./ directory</a>', "red__quicklook.pro", "", "", "", "", "          -1", "");
  
  
  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red__quicklook.html#red::quicklook", "red::quicklook", 'routine in <a href="./red__quicklook.html">red__quicklook.pro</a>', "red__quicklook.pro", "     Mats Löfdahl, ISP      (Using code from an earlier version by Jaime.)   ", "red::quicklook", " Make quick-look movies and images from raw data.   ", "align      Set this to align the cube. Implies derotate.   bit_rate      Target bit_rate used when calling write_video.   cam      Make quicklook for this camera only.   clip      A margin (in pixels) to apply to the FOV edges . The order is       [left, right, top, bottom]. If a scalar, clip this many pixels       from all edges.   core_and_wings      Automatically select states for which to make quicklook movies.       The selection includes the core and extreme wing tunings of       each prefilter. If this keyword is set, use_states is ignored.       Cannot be combined with /filter_change.   cube      If present, return without writing movies, after constructing       the first cube. (So use this together with other keywords to       specify a single movie.)   darkdatasets      Timestamp strings that identify datasets to process. Selection       menu for data sets bypassed if given.   derotate      Set this to derotate the cube to compensate for the field       rotation of the telescope.   destretch      Set this to destretch the cube to compensate for geometrical       effects from anisoplanatism. Implies derotate and align.   dirsfilter_change      Automatically select states that are directly after a change of       prefilter. Then output only the highest contrast frames but no       videos. If this keyword is set, use_states is ignored. Cannot       be combined with /core_and_wings.   format      The container format of the movies. If 'mp4' or 'avi',       write_video will make such a file. If 'mov' (Mac-friendly), a       spawned ffmpeg command will convert write_video's mp4 output to       the desired format.   gainmaxshift      When aligning, filter out isolated shifts larger than this.   mtf_deconvolve      Deconvolve data with respect to the diffraction limited MTF of       the telescope.   neuralnet      Do neural net MFBD deconvolution. (So far only in Stockholm.)   nexp      Number of exposures to base neural net deconvolutions on.   no_calib      Do not use dark and flat calibration.   no_descatter      Do not perform descattering for 7777 and 8542 data.   no_histo_optno_plot_r0      Do not plot per-scan r0 statistics for the datasets.   nthreads      Number of threads used in a couple of steps.   only_plot_r0      Only plot per-scan r0 statistics for the datasets, no video.   overwrite      Overwrite existing movies.   remote_dirremote_loginscannos      Choose scan numbers to include in the movies with an array of       scan numbers or a comma-and-dash delimited string, like       '2-5,7-20,22-30'.   size_fac      Shrink spatial dimensions by this factor. Default value is 1,       unless the largest dimension of the image data is larger than       1024. In that case, the default value is 1024/max(dim).   ssh_findtextcolor      The color to use for text annotations in the movie.   use_states      Skip state selection menu, instead make quicklook for states       that match any state in this list.   verbose      Print more screen output.   video_codec      The codec to use when making the video. Used when calling       write_video.   video_fps      Frames per second in the movie. Used when calling write_video.   x_flip      Flip the images in the X direction.   y_flip      Flip the images in the Y direction.   min_nscancube_save", "SST pipeline", "   2018-07-10 : MGL. First version.     2018-07-26 : MGL. Various improvements.     2018-08-22 : MGL. Redefine the clip keyword.     2018-09-03 : MGL. New keywords no_calib.     2018-09-11 : MGL. New keywords no_descatter, video_codec, format.                 Change keyword fps to video_fps, bitrate to bit_rate.     2019-04-09 : MGL. New keyword core_and_wings.     2019-05-22 : MGL. Reorganized the code to reduce reading of file                 headers. Implemented neuralnet and telescope-MTF                 deconvolutions. Implemented derotation and                 destretching. Bugfixes in core_and_wings state                 selection.     2022-03-22 : OA. Reorganized the code for selecting spectral                 points. Changed core_and_wings part to select points                 in wings instead of first and last ones.     2022-03-25 : OA. Changed derotation code to avoid FOV clipping                 (imported from other part of the pipeline).     2023-05-30 : MGL. New keyword filter_change.     2023-08-28 : MGL. Adaptations for mosaic data.     2026-08-10 : MGL. New keyword size_fac.   ");
  
  

