  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red_plot_diskcoordinates.html#red_plot_diskcoordinates", "red_plot_diskcoordinates", 'routine in <a href="./red_plot_diskcoordinates.html">red_plot_diskcoordinates.pro</a>', "red_plot_diskcoordinates.pro", "    Mats Löfdahl, Institute for Solar Physics   ", "red_plot_diskcoordinates", " Plot pointing on the disk.   ", "rplot      Sets the plotting range in X and Y to [-rplot,rplot].   rsun      Normalize diskpos with this number when plotting.   color      Plot the positions with this color.   over      Set this to overplot an existing plot.   psymsymsizeindx      Plot only diskpos[*,indx].   titleunitdiskpos      The disk position coordinates X=diskpos[0,*], Y=diskpos[1,*].       Assumed to be normalized to unit solar radius, unless Rsun is       given as a keyword.   ", "SST pipeline", "    2017-04-24 : MGL. First version.      2017-10-10 : MGL. New keywords title, psym, and symsize. Allow                  color to be an array.   ");
  
  

libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red_plot_r0.html", "red_plot_r0.pro", '.pro file in <a href="./dir-overview.html">./ directory</a>', "red_plot_r0.pro", "", "", "", "", "          -1", "");
  
  
  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red_plot_r0.html#red_plot_r0", "red_plot_r0", 'routine in <a href="./red_plot_r0.html">red_plot_r0.pro</a>', "red_plot_r0.pro", "    Mats Löfdahl, 2014-05-28   ", "red_plot_r0", " Plots r0 for SST data directories.   ", "dir      The directory where the data is.   today      Sets date to today. And tries to download the latest r0 file.   date      The date of observations. Any type if input understood by       date_conv.pro plus pseudo-ISO ('YYYY.MM.DD').   lapalma      If you set this and do not specify a dir, then the program will       look for data daily directories in places where they can       usually be found at the SST site in La Palma,        /data/store[1234]/  and  /data/disk[1234]/*/    localr0max      Upper plot r0 limit in m.   extension      Set this to an extension for the plot files, like 'png', 'pdf'.   tmin       Lower time limit for plot (in hours after midnight). If given        as a variable, on output it contains the real limit, e.g, as        detemined by keyword onlydata.   tmax       Upper time limit for plot (in hours after midnight). If given        as a variable, on output it contains the real limit, e.g, as        detemined by keyword onlydata.   plotvertical      Set this to plot vertical lines between scans. Such lines will       be plotted by default if all scans are with the same prefilter.   plot24       Set this to plot the large-FOV r0 value.   plot8       Set this to plot the small-FOV r0 value.   psym_plot       Plot symbol to use for plot8 and plot24 plots.   symsize_plot       Plot symbol size to use for plot8 and plot24 plots.   scan24       Set this to plot the large-FOV r0 for CRISP/CHROMIS scans.   scan8       Set this to plot the small-FOV r0 for CRISP/CHROMIS scans.   psym_scan       Plot symbol to use for scan8 and scan24 plots.   symsize_scan       Plot symbol size to use for scan8 and scan24 plots.   markdata       Set this to mark when data were collected in the full-day r0        plot. Requires that the directory where data from the day is        known or can be deduced.   onlydata       Limit time interval to when data were collected.   dt_mean       Time window for running mean in minutes. Do not plot running        mean if dt_mean is set to zero.   noplotplotstats       Set this to plot r0 statistics vs scan number.   instruments      A list of instruments to plot scans and statistics for.   ", "SST observations", "     2014-05-28 : MGL. Start working on it, based loosely on earlier                   routines sst_plotonedir and sst_plotdirs. It can                   now plot r0 for an entire day and mark time                   intervals when data of various kinds were collected                   (red and blue, but also darks, flats, polcal).       2014-06-09 : MGL. Speed up directory search by using new routine                   red_find_matching_dirs.       2014-08-18 : MGL. Use red_strreplace(), not strreplace().       2014-10-10 : TL. Fixed an issue with calculating the isodate                   string.       2014-10-10 : MGL. 8x8 r0 data does not exist before 2013-10-28.                   Set plot24 to true to replace plot8 for earlier                   dates. Make sure to keep within the plot range when                   marking directories. All cg command to just load                   themselves, not add, and then execute only when                   writing to file. Mark TRIPPEL data directories with                   their own color (pink).       2014-10-10 : MGL. Bugfix: do not assume the r0time array is a 2D                   array.       2014-10-16 : MGL. Store time intervals of the different                   directories to disk to speed up next plot. Encode                   plot interval in plot file name so we can do                   multiple plots without overwriting. Make tick mark                   labels as properly formatted times. Accept string                   values for tmin and tmax.       2015-06-28 : MGL. New keyword  noplot . Fixed bug in calculating                   when data directory started. Remove old code that                   dealt with time-stamped directories, keyword dir                   can now be just the date directory. New keywords                    scan24  and  scan8 , added code to plot r0 for                   scans.       2015-08-10 : MGL. Write all plots to subdir dir-analysis. Now                   allowed to give dir without trailing slash.       2015-08-12 : MGL. Stop using red_timeaxis.pro to get away from                   its many dependencies. Import Pit's gen_timeaxis to                   the crispred namespace and use it instead.       2015-08-17 : MGL. Can now get directory from config.txt.       2016-05-19 : MGL. Update for CHROMIS. Read file headers with                   red_readhead, this gives us FITS keywords. Works                   now with plot8 and plot24. New keywords crispscans                   and chromisscans to plot CRISP and CHROMIS scans                   separately with scan8 and scan24.       2016-08-15 : MGL. New keywords allowing change of plot symbols.                   Also, can now set dt_mean=0 to remove the smoothed                   curves.       2016-09-07 : MGL. Parts moved to analyze-directories method.                   Make plotting work with output from that method.       2016-09-08 : MGL. New keyword plotstats, implemented plotting r0                   statistics vs scan number. Remove unused keywords                   crispscans and chromisscans.       2016-09-12 : MGL. Plotstats plots: add a time axis on top, shade                   between min and max.       2016-09-27 : MGL. New keyword instruments.       2016-10-03 : MGL. Add vertical lines in plotstats plot.   ");
  
  

