libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red_sumfiles.html", "red_sumfiles.pro", '.pro file in <a href="./dir-overview.html">./ directory</a>', "red_sumfiles.pro", "", "", "", "", "          -1", "");
  
  
  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red_sumfiles.html#red_sumfiles", "red_sumfiles", 'routine in <a href="./red_sumfiles.html">red_sumfiles.pro</a>', "red_sumfiles.pro", "    Mats Löfdahl, ISP   ", "red_sumfiles", " Return the average (sum/number) of the image frames defined by a  list of file names.   ", "time_avg       The average timestamp of the summed frames.   time_beg       The beginning of the first exposure in the summed frames.   time_end       The end of the last exposure in the summed frames.   summed       The summed frames, without division with the number of summed frames.   nsum       Number of frames actually summed   check       Check for bad frames before summing.   limlun       Logical unit number for where to store checking results.   pinhole_align       Align before summing if set. Use brightest feature (assumed to        be a pinhole) to align on. If both select_align and        pinhole_align are set, pinhole_align is ignored.   select_align       Align before summing if set. User gets to select feature to        align on.   gain       Gain frame with bad pixels zeroed. If backscatter correction        is supposed to be performed, the gain must have been        calculated from a backscatter corrected flat.   dark       Dark frame.   xycbackscatter_gain       The gain needed to do backscatter correction. Iff        backscatter_gain and backscatter_psf are given, do the        correction.   backscatter_psf       The psf needed to do backscatter correction. Iff        backscatter_gain and backscatter_psf are given, do the        correction.     xyc : out, optional, type= lonarr(2)          The (x,y) coordinates of the feature used for alignment.   nthreads       The number of threads to use for backscatter correction.   filter       Size of the medianfilter to use when checking data.   files_list      The list of image files, the contents of which to sum.   ", "CRISP pipeline", "   2013-06-04 : Split from monolithic version of crispred.pro.     2013-08-15 : MGL. Added documentation. Code from last year that                 allows subpixel alignment before summing.     2013-08-16 : MGL. New code to optionally do backscatter                 correction, as well as gain and dark correction, and                 filling of bad pixels. Removed unused keyword                  notime . Use red_time2double rather than                 time2double.     2013-08-27 : MGL. Let the subprogram find out its own name.     2013-09-09 : MGL. Move per-frame correction for dark, gain, and                 back scatter to inside of conditional for pinhole                 alignment.     2013-09-13 : MGL. Lower the limit for least number of frames                 needed to do checking from 10 to 3.     2013-12-10 : PS. Keyword lim     2013-12-11 : PS. Also pass back the number of summed frames     2014-01-27 : MGL. Use red_com rather than red_centroid.     2014-04-11 : MGL. New keywords select_align and xyc. Limit number                 of repeats in the alignment so bad data can                 terminate.     2016-05-20 : MGL. Rewrite the setting up and reading part to                 support files with more than a single frame. Use                 red_readdata and red_redhead.     2016-05-22 : MGL. Rewrite the summing part, take care of the easy                 cases first.     2016-05-22 : MGL. Remove  old  keyword. If we have  old  ana                 headers, they should be taken care of in                 red_readdata.     2016-05-23 : MGL. Added time_beg and time_end keywords. Changed                 time keyword to time_avg. Do summing in double                 precision.     2016-05-24 : MGL. Removed filtering of FITS headers.     2016-05-25 : MGL. Use red_progressbar.     2016-05-30 : MGL. Report how many files are being summed.     2016-06-09 : MGL. Bugfix in printout of what frames were rejected.                 Bugfix in summing without checking.     2016-09-21 : THI. Make the size of the medianfilter a parameter.     2016-09-22 : MGL. Make time_beg etc. with 6 decimals.       The average image.   ");
  
  

