  libdata[libdataItem++] = new Array("./red_sumheaders.html#red_sumheaders", "red_sumheaders", 'routine in <a href="./red_sumheaders.html">red_sumheaders.pro</a>', "red_sumheaders.pro", "    Mats Löfdahl   ", "red_sumheaders", " Calculates the combined FITS header for files summed with  red_sumfiles or rdx_sumfiles or by momfbd processing.   If any of the time_* keywords is not supplied, the headers will be  parsed instead.   ", "nsum      The number of summed frames. Specify this if some were excluded       from the sum.   discard      Corresponding to the redux program's discard keyword.   framenumbers      Framenumbers to be used for the supplied files. If not supplied,       the framenumbers will be parsed from the headers.   time_beg      The start-time for the summed burst.   time_end      The end-time for the summed burst.   time_avg      The average time for the summed burst.   files      The names of the summed files.   sum      The array representing the summed files.   ", "SST pipeline", "    2017-03-13 : MGL. First version.      2017-03-21 : MGL. New keywords discard.      2017-06-02 : MGL. Use red_fitsaddpar.      2017-07-06 : THI. Adding keywords: framenumbers, time_beg,                  time_end, time_avg      2017-09-01 : THI. Get date_beg and framenumbers from file.      2017-09-07 : MGL. Changed red_fitsaddpar --&gt; red_fitsaddkeyword.      2024-06-10 : MGL. Allow for files from multiple cameras (WB and                  PD).       The combined header.   ");
  
  

